## Rushing Yards Statistics
The top 5 players with the most rushing yards are:
* Keaton Mitchell with 93 yards
* Mark Andrews with 559 yards
* Melvin Gordon III with 46 yards
* Rashod Bateman with 408 yards
* Kenyan Drake with 31 yards
```python
import pandas as pd
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
# Load the data
rushing_df = pd.read_csv('baltimore-ravens_rushing_2023.csv')
# Plot the top 5 players with the most rushing yards
top_rushers = rushing_df.sort_values(by='YDS.1', ascending=False).head(5)
plt.figure(figsize=(10,6))
plt.bar(top_rushers['PLAYER'], top_rushers['YDS.1'])
plt.xlabel('Player')
plt.ylabel('Rushing Yards')
plt.title('Top 5 Players with the Most Rushing Yards')
plt.show()
```
